    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Bone of a stag’s heart, is of the same rank with the foregoing [cornu unicornis] [i.e. being superstitious and ludicrous as medicine] (Quincy 185 s.v. os [d]e corde cervi), used medically | meaning unknown</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
